% map is func: deterministic *if* its function argument is. Calling it with
% the deterministic wrapper likes! keeps that promise; calling it with the
% plain relation likes silently breaks it — map still runs, but leaves a
% choice point despite its signature.

kind guest type.
kind dish type.
symbol mario, anna : guest.
symbol pizza, pasta, gelato : dish.

pred likes i:guest, o:dish.
likes mario pizza.
likes mario pasta.
likes anna gelato.

func likes! guest -> dish.
likes! A B :- likes A B, !.

func map list A, (func A -> B) -> list B.
map [] _ [].
map [X|XS] F [Y|YS] :- F X Y, map XS F YS.

main :-
  map [mario, anna] likes! Correct,
  print "correctly called:" Correct,
  map [mario, anna] likes Wrong, print "wrongly called:" Wrong, fail.
main :- print "wrongly called: backtracked into a second result".
